    unreviewed): so is a last-ring record (a name RANG_RECORD_NAME gives,
    directly in its owner's branch; C2 item 5).

    @interacts  reads the user database (branch_user) for a file directly
                in an outbox branch. Writes nothing.
    @deps       branch_user; pathlib; ROOT, MAIL, OUTBOX_NAME,
                SEND_LOCK_NAME, RANG_RECORD_NAME, WAKE_LOCK_NAMES,
                SHARED_WRITABLE_FILE_MODE, SHARED_OWNED_FILE_MODE,
                SEND_LOCK_MODE, RANG_RECORD_MODE, WAKE_LOCK_MODE.
    @complexity O(1), and at most one user lookup.
    @alloc      none.
