    @interacts  reads cards/*.json through all_cards; prints to stdout.
    @deps       all_cards, describe_card, printable.
    @complexity O(c) over c cards (a few dozen).
    @alloc      the list of cards, freed on exit.
    """
    cards = all_cards()
    if not cards:
        print("no cards")
