    `card`: a caller may pass none (C2's route signature allows it). P3
    fix round 1a (Claude Opus 5.5, unreviewed): the audit's LOW-6. Since
    SSH task 0 the gate (C3) comes through route_and_deliver, as tc send
    does, never here directly. `header_note`, when given, ends the header
    line after a comma (the gate's, C3). The .tmp is made by
    write_new_file, so nothing is ever written through a file or link
    already at its name; since SHARED fix round 5 such a name takes the
    next number (below), where before it refused the send, exit 1. An
